            "2 Khrista thau the! Hallelujah!",
            "Jisu mei guay neihlaa tho:",
            "Ryanramei lev theihmei khou ^&8",
            "Ravguangc Nac ringcthau dat the.",
            "",
            "3 Khrista thau the! Hallelujah!",
            "Kamei saamei kumc thau the,",
